  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "On November 10, 2026, coinciding with National Heroes Day, President Prabowo Subianto formally recognized 19 individuals as National Heroes at a ceremony held at the State Palace in Jakarta. The selection includes various figures who contributed significantly to the nation's history, such as RM Margono, guerrilla leader Lieutenant Colonel Sroedji, Sultan Ibrahim Chaliludin of Paser, and Kiai Abbas, also known as the Tiger from the West. Discussions surrounding the appointments included remarks from officials regarding the selection process, with reports noting that the president reviewed specific proposals before the final designation. Regional leaders and officials expressed hope that these honors would serve as a source of inspiration for the youth and help preserve the memory of the struggles faced by these historical figures for the sake of the nation's independence.",
